- project = @notification.project
- fee_pct = ENV.fetch('PLATFORM_FEE', '5.0').tr(',', '.').to_f / 100.0
- gross = project.contributions.where(payment_method: 'Stripe', stripe_transferred: true).sum(:value).to_f
- gross = project.contributions.where(payment_method: 'Stripe', state: 'confirmed').sum(:value).to_f if gross == 0
- net = (gross * (1.0 - fee_pct)).round(2)
- currency_sym = project.currency || 'EUR'
- settled_at = project.stripe_payout_paid_at || project.stripe_settled_at

|Bonjour #{project.user.display_name},
br
br
|Les fonds du projet #{link_to(project.name, project_url(project))} sont arrivés sur votre compte bancaire.
br
br
table[style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 500px;"]
  tr[style="background: #f8fafc;"]
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Projet
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"] #{project.name}
  tr
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Montant reçu
    td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; color: #16a34a; font-weight: bold;"]
      = number_to_currency(net, unit: currency_sym, format: '%n %u')
  - if settled_at.present?
    tr[style="background: #f8fafc;"]
      td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; font-weight: bold;"] Date de réception
      td[style="padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;"]
        = l(settled_at.to_date, format: :long)
br
br
|Vous pouvez vérifier votre relevé bancaire. Si vous ne voyez pas les fonds, contactez votre banque ou notre équipe à #{mail_to Configuration[:email_contact]}.
br
br
|Merci,
br
|L’équipe #{Configuration[:company_name]}
